[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8880.75, "timestamp": "02:28:00", "text": "关心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8885.03, "timestamp": "02:28:05", "text": "首款车型所需的资金。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8887.99, "timestamp": "02:28:07", "text": "感觉太远了，我就想，我还是算了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8890.55, "timestamp": "02:28:10", "text": "享受我的时光。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8892.389, "timestamp": "02:28:12", "text": "所以，我会在日本努力工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8896.59, "timestamp": "02:28:16", "text": "至少这样我才能拥有新款车型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8900.59, "timestamp": "02:28:20", "text": "东西。是啊，不过没关系。全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8902.95, "timestamp": "02:28:22", "text": "好的。我不想为了钱而做这件事。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8921.27, "timestamp": "02:28:41", "text": "时间。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8923.71, "timestamp": "02:28:43", "text": "真希望有机会能和你合作。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8927.99, "timestamp": "02:28:47", "text": "能。我们可以以后再计划。患病的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8932.03, "timestamp": "02:28:52", "text": "永远在这里，就像我们随时可以一起玩一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8934.75, "timestamp": "02:28:54", "text": "每当我这样做的时候，我们都会在一起。"}]